  "version": "1.0.2",
  "author": "FastVideo + Nuva Lab + T8mars + IndexTeam",
  "nsfw": false,
  "description": "Cloned-voice lip-sync on FastH3 Omni. Type the line, pick the mood, supply a voice sample and a picture: IndexTTS 2.5 speaks the line in that voice and FastH3 Omni lip-syncs the character to it in one generation. The same card as the Emotion TTS Lip-Sync v2 card, on a faster model (about 20% faster per shot with its sparse attention on) that stays closer to your reference picture. It is a separate pack because FastH3 Omni needs the v0.42.0 engine and the TTS pack works on older engines.\n\nDEPENDENCIES, READ BEFORE INSTALLING. Adds the comfyui-indextts25-T8 custom node (pinned) and 7.7 GB of IndexTTS 2.5 weights into the engine's models/TTS folder. The node pins transformers below 5 and its install DOWNGRADES the engine's transformers (5.x -> 4.57.x); SimpliGen's maintainer has confirmed this is allowed and sticks across engine updates. If the IndexTTS node cannot find its weights on the first run, restart SimpliGen once.",
  "tags": [
    "Local",
    "Video",
    "R2V",
    "Lip-Sync",
    "TTS",
    "Audio",
    "MiniMax H3",
    "Distilled"
  ],
  "minComfyuiVersion": "v0.42.0",
