          "sizeGB": 52,
          "notes": "FastH3 Omni int8 (22.2 GB, FastVideo/FastH3-Omni-Comfy, pinned) + the shared MiniMax H3 text encoder and VAEs + the IndexTTS 2.5 weights (7.7 GB, 26 files into models/TTS/IndexTTS-2.5) and the comfyui-indextts25-T8 node. H3 part: MiniMaxH3SigmaShift 12 video / 3 audio, euler/simple, 8 steps, no CFG (the FastH3 Omni settings), plus a Sparse attention switch (on by default): ModelAttentionBackend (comfy kitchen) then BlockSparseAttention (vsa, keep 10%, from 20% of the steps), selected by a core switch node. Faster Attention (Sage) is off on this card: the app's Faster Attention hook would also patch the IndexTTS model (it treats every input named model as a video model), and the engine rejects the job. The prepended audio binding is the bare marker <Audio 1>: fully_copy. Needs engine v0.42.0+. Needs app 1.77.0+ (pack switches). MEASURED 2026-10-23 through the app (RTX 4070 Ti 12 GB, 864x480, 6 s, one reference picture): 105-108 s end to end including IndexTTS with Sparse attention on, 150 s with it off (the v2 Turbo-chain card: 133-137 s); 7 word line word-exact 3/3 with the speech copied verbatim; 22 word line in 6 s garbled at the start (too long for the shot). The IndexTTS node downgrades the engine's transformers to the 4.5x line (allowed by SimpliGen's maintainer)."
